phrase: drop maximum up to count {k}
phrase: remove largest values up to {k}
test: list=10,40,20,40,30 k=1
expect: => i=1 r=0.0 ok=true s="dropped max: 1" errors=0 n=4 res=[10,20,40,30] cache=0 hits=0
