phrase: recursive tally retry reduction by factor {factor}
slot: factor int
test: list=10,20,30,40 factor=3
expect: => i=4 r=0.0 ok=true s="reduction rounds: 4" errors=0 n=4 res=[10,20,30,40] cache=0 hits=0
