phrase: filter pairs backwards summing to {target_sum}
test: list=2,8,3,7,5,5 target_sum=10
expect: => i=3 r=0.0 ok=true s="searched pairs in reverse: 3" errors=0 n=6 res=[5,5,3,7,2,8] cache=0 hits=0
